[{"id":"72998","date":"2026-11-02T10:38:12+00:00","text":"🚨 ICYMI : Binance got hacked for $6.3B last week, the largest theft in crypto history. Here’s how it unfolded: > suspicious wallet transfers flagged on Oct. 29 > Tether and Circle freeze over $2.36B > Binance pauses withdrawals, pledges to cover all losses > Aave freezes markets after attacker borrows $44.6M > total frozen assets reach $3B > Binance confirms $6.3B stolen > initial findings point to a compromised engineer’s laptop > investigators link attack to North Korea’s TraderTraitor > Binance uncovers additional breach points > reserves $6.34B to cover losses, including $5B in matching tokens > Blockaid warns EIP-7702 may have helped bypass safeguards > FBI and Secret Service join recovery efforts > Aave reopens markets, confirms contracts unaffected > US politicians clash over regulation > Binance reports 90% replenished by Oct. 31 > replenishment reaches 95% on Nov. 1 > withdrawals begin reopening across 15 networks Sunday > Binance reports $3.64B net withdrawals in Sunday’s first 9.5 hours > on Nov. 2, Binance reports withdrawal volumes stabilizing Read here for full Binance hack coverage: https://ct.com/search?q=binance News | Markets | YouTube","image":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/PiXlU18fLMA9BoJ8akyci2tM47_UiOPkZTFAFlR7LESWYb60TAru2zUj_2NC5Vc8qPPoGwepYSKrI7rHKURo1PHVDlhstQQJGYfFoI8-n_53T6dv0YDM6UrhcuUk9OxFqSYy9Elb_H7vMd_btUE0-UIwJ8Qr7ZDmG-9lBhVoLc9m4XM0xIQ6fANH3Dmac1Posy3oX2o5XK_eyi7JaD7d_Mf-LlAaj3s-zleK9GVrMkZlcpt8JifRuhgwxJ_sWtsp20EA0wcstCKDaEvyr-CzDEFb5gNqKq379f2-SXyRtSmv5eieDBkAUefsj5zvHRwEOSuCxNa92PGWir1esaFulw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"72996","date":"2026-11-02T06:07:50+00:00","text":"🚨 NOW : Gate says it froze two accounts tied to the Binance hacker after Lookonchain flagged $250,000 in deposits to the exchange over 12 hours. News | Markets | YouTube","image":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/SYEHyfh4EPj6rT2OwFsaH3A9Zio5aRYxAuCGH9nTXzajpw1cfm0wEUPZzW8BvKXMU18bZ5xU5Dryj3Dy-V_UlXD3